{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story-Driven Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a slow-burning mystery that gradually unfolds. You'll face reality-distorting events, confront your past, and deal with threats beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif2.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Linear and Mission-Based Structure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not an open-world game. It progresses through a series of structured events and tasks that increase in difficulty and tension over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Limited Replayability</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a set ending. However, anomalies and event timing are randomized, encouraging players to replay for a slightly different experience each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif4.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Average Playtime: 2\u201320 Hours</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playtime ranges from 2 to 20 hours. Observation, attention, and reaction time can influence this duration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Single Player Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player must survive the night through careful observation and making the right decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif6.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content and Core Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 15 different security cameras</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Real-time observation and anomaly reporting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Tasks requiring physical intervention beyond cameras (server reset, bomb bag interception)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Defense and hiding systems against external threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Story-driven visual and environmental details</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time-Based Gameplay Structure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place over a 7-hour in-game night shift. Each hour introduces new threats and challenges, increasing pressure and difficulty as time progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif3.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Visual Style and Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The visual design mimics low-resolution security camera feeds, paired with eerie lighting and unsettling soundscapes to build a tense and immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif5.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RTX and DLSS Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your graphics performance and improve image quality with RTX and DLSS support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/rtxgif.gif?t=1751287355\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618890?t=1751287355","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/39d